                        "username": "waffle2k"
                    },
                    "message": "thank you zoey for this work. this change introduces a bit of a change away from relying on systemd to ensure that conflicting actions aren't taken.\n\nmind confirming if a systemd `Conflicts=` issue was at play here?\n\nlooks good to me"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Zoey YJ Chung",
                        "email": "zoey.yj.chung.wiwynn@gmail.com",
                        "username": "zoeychung10"
                    },
                    "message": "@pmb@meta.com We observed that the *Conflicts* will stop the first power control when power control commands are executed consecutively."
                },
